@startuml 17_state_agent
title Agent background-service lifecycle and pairing
[*] --> NOT_PAIRED : first installation
NOT_PAIRED --> PAIRING : user initiates
PAIRING --> PAIRED : authorized approval + private poll
PAIRING --> NOT_PAIRED : denied / expiry / cancelled
PAIRED --> STARTING : credential loaded from protected store
STARTING --> COLLECTING : HTTPS API ready
STARTING --> OFFLINE_BACKOFF : network failure
COLLECTING --> REPORTING : sample ready
REPORTING --> COLLECTING : 202 accepted
REPORTING --> OFFLINE_BACKOFF : network/server failure
OFFLINE_BACKOFF --> REPORTING : retry allowed
OFFLINE_BACKOFF --> STARTING : restart
REPORTING --> NEEDS_REPAIR : 401 revoked/invalid
STARTING --> NEEDS_REPAIR : credential lost
NEEDS_REPAIR --> PAIRING : explicit physical re-pair
COLLECTING --> STOPPED : service stop
REPORTING --> STOPPED : service stop
OFFLINE_BACKOFF --> STOPPED : service stop
NEEDS_REPAIR --> STOPPED : service stop
STOPPED --> STARTING : OS reboot, credential retained
note right of PAIRED : Setup window may close; service continues.
@enduml
